| Defect | Tool that catches it when exercised |
|---|---|
| out of bounds, use after free, leaks. | AddressSanitizer. |
| signed overflow, bad shift, null misuse. | UBSan. |
| uninitialised reads. | MemorySanitizer (clang) or Valgrind. |

